    "title": "2 theft suspects wanted for targeting commercial buildings in Orange County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Police are searching for two theft suspects wanted for targeting commercial buildings in Orange County. Over the last several weeks, the two men entered a vacant building near 1120 E. 17th Street and stole copper pipes and air conditioning units, the Santa Ana Police Department said. In total, the pair is responsible for over $50,000 worth of stolen property and damages. Police released surveillance images of the suspects in case the public recognizes them. Both were described as Hispanic men. Anyone who recognizes them or has information on the thefts is asked to call Detective A. Castro at 714-245-8345 or email ACastro@santa-ana.org. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KTLA.",
